      "id": "claim_5cd66082af014911a0d585bf12d822ae",
      "statement": "DocumentLoader.can_handle dispatches on source type: strings must be existing files whose extension is in the loader's SUPPORTED_FORMATS (case-insensitive), BytesIO streams are MIME-sniffed with python-magic and matched against supported formats, and any exception during the check returns False rather than raising.",
