    {
      "id": "claim_28bf04fbf97f4bc4bde525a991a59a09",
      "statement": "The base class provides shared conversion machinery: convert_to_images renders PDFs page-by-page via pypdfium2 at default scale 300/72 into JPEG bytes keyed by page index; URLs are detected with urlparse and captured as headless-Chromium full-page screenshots via Playwright (optionally clicking an Accept cookie button, waiting screenshot_timeout ms) then optionally resized and split into vertical 1000px PNG chunks; missing Playwright raises an ImportError with install instructions.",
