      "statement": "CachedDocumentLoader memoizes load() in a TTLCache (default maxsize=100, ttl=300s) keyed on (source, vision_mode) — path string for files, getvalue() bytes for streams — and concrete loaders add vision_mode to their cachedmethod hash keys, so toggling vision mode invalidates the cache while repeated loads within the TTL are free.",
